    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "Tailored Care Placement Agency <team@tailoredcarelivingllc.com>",
        "toEmail": "team@tailoredcarelivingllc.com",
        "subject": "=[PLACEMENT] New request — {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.clientFirstName }} {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.clientLastName }} · {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.moveIn }} · {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.reference }}",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "=A new placement request was received through the Tailored Care Placement Agency form.\n\nReference: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.reference }}\nReceived: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.receivedAt }}\n\nABOUT THE PERSON MAKING THIS REQUEST\nI am: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.requesterRole || 'Not provided' }}\nName: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.requesterName || 'Not provided' }}\nOrganization: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.organization || 'Not provided' }}\nPhone: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.requesterPhone || 'Not provided' }}\nEmail: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.requesterEmail || 'Not provided' }}\nBest time to reach: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.bestTime || 'Not provided' }}\n\nPERSON NEEDING PLACEMENT\nFirst name: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.clientFirstName || 'Not provided' }}\nLast name: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.clientLastName || 'Not provided' }}\nDate of birth: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.clientDob || 'Not provided' }}\nPhone: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.clientPhone || 'Not provided' }}\nGender: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.clientGender || 'Not provided' }}\nPreferred language: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.preferredLanguage || 'Not provided' }}\nVeteran: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.veteran || 'Not provided' }}\nCurrent location: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.currentLocation || 'Not provided' }}\nExpected discharge / release: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.dischargeDate || 'Not provided' }}\nLegal decision-maker: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.decisionMaker || 'Not provided' }}\nGuardian / POA / payee contact: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.decisionMakerContact || 'Not provided' }}\n\nPLACEMENT NEEDS\nSetting requested: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.settingTypes || 'Not provided' }}\nSituation: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.situations || 'Not provided' }}\nMove-in timeframe: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.moveIn || 'Not provided' }}\nPreferred area: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.preferredArea || 'Not provided' }}\nAreas to avoid: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.areasToAvoid || 'Not provided' }}\n\nINCOME & BUDGET\nIncome sources: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.incomeSources || 'Not provided' }}\nApproximate monthly income: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.monthlyIncome || 'Not provided' }}\nMonthly housing budget: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.housingBudget || 'Not provided' }}\nHas current photo ID: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.hasPhotoId || 'Not provided' }}\n\nGENERAL DAILY LIVING\nWalks without help: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.walksUnaided || 'Not provided' }}\nUses walker, cane, or wheelchair: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.mobilityAid || 'Not provided' }}\nCan climb stairs: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.climbsStairs || 'Not provided' }}\nManages own medications: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.managesMeds || 'Not provided' }}\nHandles own personal care: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.personalCare || 'Not provided' }}\nNeeds help with meals: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.mealHelp || 'Not provided' }}\nSmokes or vapes: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.smokes || 'Not provided' }}\nHas pet or service animal: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.pet || 'Not provided' }}\nAccommodations / right fit: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.accommodations || 'Not provided' }}\n\nBACKGROUND & SPECIAL CONSIDERATIONS\nOn probation / parole: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.probation || 'Not provided' }}\nResidence restrictions: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.residenceRestrictions || 'Not provided' }}\nIn recovery program: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.recoveryProgram || 'Not provided' }}\nHas active case manager: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.activeCaseManager || 'Not provided' }}\nAgent / case manager contact: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.agentContact || 'Not provided' }}\nAdditional information: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.additionalInfo || 'Not provided' }}\n\nCONSENT & SIGNATURE\nSigned (typed name): {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.signature || 'Not provided' }}\nRelationship to person: {{ $('Validate and Normalize').item.json.relationship || 'Not provided' }}\nConsent box checked: Yes\n\nThis request is also saved in the \"Placement Requests\" tab of the Google Sheet. It contains private personal information; please do not forward it outside the team.",
